ry":"Consorcio es una empresa líder en Chile en los negocios de seguros, financiero y de corredores de bolsa. En este video, Alejandro Truan, sugerente de advanced analytics en Consorcio, nos cuenta como el área de tecnología apoyó la institución en su proceso de cambio de visión, que desde el 2018 pasó a ser centrada en el cliente. La base de este cambio estaba en la centralización de todos los datos del grupo.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/consorcio_logo%401x.4f4ed9a3e34f945b60ad8a91a9b3a88f1d06b8fb.png","displayLocation":"Chile","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2020-01-01","enableShare":"1","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/consorcioanalytics/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Historia del cliente","customer-name":"Consorcio Financiero","headline":"Cómo AWS ayudó Consorcio a formar bases para dar un mejor servicio a los clientes"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#business-category#cust-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#business-category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:03+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:37:45+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mobile","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","description":"Front-End Web \u0026 Mobile","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated"