dsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#melco","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"melco","dateCreated":"2020-07-09T20:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:40:52+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Melco Resorts \u0026 Entertainment is a developer, owner, and operator of casino gaming and entertainment casino resort facilities in Asia. Chang Lim, Melco\u0027s vice president of digital transformation, and Martin Fuller, Melco\u0027s DX platform product leader, explain how the company is utilizing Amazon Web Services (AWS) to help enhance the experience of guests as it looks to scale operations. By running in the AWS Cloud, Melco\u0027s casino management system setup time has gone from 9 months to just 4 weeks.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/melco-logo@1x.cca8157d73483beaccbc67b735696678215f7e33.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/melco-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Melco Resorts \u0026 Entertainment","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Melco Resorts \u0026 Entertainment Enhances Guest Experience on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#websites-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Websites \u0026 Web Apps","description":"Websites \u0026 Web Apps","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:28:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:36:00+0000"},{"id":"custom