mpete in the 36th edition of the America’s Cup in 2021. The team is using an HPC environment running on Amazon EC2 Spot Instances to help design its boat for the competition.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/INEOS-Team-logo.c61b42bd13bebeeca357f07f81ea8a0e0d3e660b.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/ineos-team-uk-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Ineos Team UK","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"INEOS TEAM UK Accelerates Boat Design for America’s Cup Using AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#high-performance-computing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"High Performance Computing","description":"High Performance Computing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+