rs of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#tempo-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"tempo-case-study","dateCreated":"2020-06-09T00:48:23+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T23:23:23+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Tempo.co relies on AWS to support its website and mobile app to make sure that readers of online news stay informed even when the biggest stories break and site visits spike 400 percent.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Tempo_Customer-Reference_Logo.bc80a5c5e20f262f13e8c0451f720d54b1619e57.png","displayLocation":"Indonesia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/tempo/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Tempo.co","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Indonesian Magazine Transitions Seamlessly from Print to Digital Using AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#asean","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"ASEAN","de