ital-one-tech-transformation-enables-improved-agility-innovation","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"capital-one-tech-transformation-enables-improved-agility-innovation","dateCreated":"2021-01-11T20:04:30+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-19T03:04:52+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Capital One, one of the largest banks in the United States, announced in November 2020 that it had completed the migration from all eight of its on-premises data centers to Amazon Web Services (AWS), becoming the first US bank to report that it was all in on the cloud. By migrating to the cloud and changing its technology operations, Capital One has been able to scale to meet demand and move faster in a variety of ways.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/capital-one-logo-1x.0e2c860505af688847cd525098b3510e556ab395.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Financial Services","sortDate":"2020-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/capital-one-tech-transformation-enables-improved-agility-innovation/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Capital One","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2020","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Capital One’s Tech Transformation Enables Improved Agility and Innovation"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T0