rom 30 minutes to 5 minutes, and increases the customer base for one application by four times. Headquartered in Oslo, Norway, the company is a leading provider of cloud-based business applications. Visma moved many of its .NET applications to AWS, relying on Amazon Aurora MySQL, Amazon EC2, and AWS CloudFormation.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/events/Nordics/visma.fd0b746d073b0ad4eba5aba526fb78a567065693.png","displayLocation":"Norway","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/visma-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Visma","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Visma Migrates Windows Workloads to AWS to Enable Agility and Speed Software Delivery"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T