e core tools like software development kits (SDKs), code editors, and continuous integration and delivery (CI/CD) services for DevOps software development. Use machine learning (ML) -guided best practices and abstractions to improve agility, security, velocity, and code quality.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T01:14:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-lg-electronics","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-lg-electronics","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T14:55:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-09-21T00:18:56+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"LG Electronics (LG) launched LG ThinQ—a global brand of home appliances, consumer electronics, and services featuring artificial intelligence technology. LG manufactures home appliances such as TVs, refrigerators, and cooling fans.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/LGElectronics_Customer-Reference_Logo.1c4b737c460261b906da85679877712ead029ee3.png","displayLocation":"Asia Pacific","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eLG Electronics launches \u001cLG ThinQ,\u001d a global artificial intelligence brand offering products and services equipped with artificial intelligence technology. LG ThinQ with artificial intelligence evolves while learning the surrounding environment, ultimately providing optimized functions for the user\u0026#39;s active space. LG Electronics has built an IoT platform that can service LG ThinQ through AWS IoT Core and AWS Managed Services.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Electronics \u0026 Semiconductors","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/lg-electronics/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"LG Electronics","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: LG Electronics"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBA