:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#healthcare-lifesciences","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"healthcare-lifesciences","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#genoplan","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"genoplan","dateCreated":"2020-05-04T20:11:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:30+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Genoplan offers products and services related to genetic analysis using biotechnology and IT, and provides information about individuals\u0027 genetic predisposition in a simple way. It also offers exercise tips and improving lifestyle habits related to various areas of genetic studies, culled from analyzing large volumes of genetic data. This helps its customers such as companies plan for personalized health care products and services.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/genoplan-logo@1x.6c1abbaed89380c86a8a9bf4a530cc3083fa5e4a.png","displayLocation":"Asia Pacific","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Life Sciences","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlin