ription":"\u003cp\u003eThis tag is initially being created specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/health/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#uc-santa-cruz-genomics-institute-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"uc-santa-cruz-genomics-institute-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-19T15:20:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:24+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Using AWS, the UC Santa Cruz Genomics Institute processed 20,000 cancer samples in days instead of months, saving hundreds of thousands of dollars and powering innovative new research. The Institute—which was founded to lead UC Santa Cruz\u0027s efforts to unlock the world\u0027s genomic data—analyzes computational genomics, cancer genomics, and other genomic data.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/UC-Santa-Cruz-Genomics-Institute_Logo.25da0f799038a6d4f0a7e1cdcc67d05bcb87283a.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eRead the UC Santa Cruz Genomics Institute customer case study, powered by the AWS cloud. AWS provides cloud computing services to hundreds of thousands of customers.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Education","