ted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#cimri-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"cimri-case-study","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T17:10:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:36+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"By using AWS, Cimri can easily scale to meet traffic demands, avoid downtime, and improve user experience. The Turkey-based firm operates a price and product comparison website.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Cimri_Customer-Reference_Logo.538765810c4d0f1b75d63fc9e620de5d36b4a1b4.png","displayLocation":"Turkey","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eBy using Amazon Web Services (AWS), Cimri can easily scale to meet traffic demands, avoid downtime, and improve user experience. The Turkey-based firm operates a price and product comparison website. It chose to move to AWS to run the entire infrastructure supporting its comparison engine, and currently uses Amazon Kinesis, the Amazon OpenSearch Service, and Amazon Relational Database Service.\u003c/p\u003e\n","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2017-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/cimri/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Cimri","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2017","contentType":"Customer Story","head