ute nodes, analyze genomic sequencing data in days instead of weeks, and easily manage cluster access credentials. Led by Dr. Mitch Guttman, the Guttman Lab is a Pasadena, California-based research laboratory specializing in the study of large noncoding RNA genes.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/CaltechGuttmanLab_Customer-Reference_Logo.733e0fbf6658e39afb853c9da8170d3e1f0ef1af.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Guttman Lab at the California Institute of Technology uses an AWS-based high-performance computing (HPC) cluster to quickly add new compute nodes, analyze genomic sequencing data in days instead of weeks, and easily manage cluster access credentials.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Professional Services","sortDate":"2016-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/caltech-guttman-lab/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Caltech Guttman Lab","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2016","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Caltech Guttman Lab Case Study"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#business-applications","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applica