tity, \u0026 Compliance","description":"Security, Identity, \u0026 Compliance","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","description":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#iam","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Identity and Access Management","description":"AWS Identity and Access Management","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"IoT","description":"IoT","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:05+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#iot","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Internet of Things (IoT)","description":"Internet of Things (IoT)","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:19+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-08-22T20:28:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#semiconductors","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Semiconductors","description":"Semiconductors","dateCreated":"2020-08-31T04:01:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-mediatek","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-mediatek","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:53:12+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-09-21T00:18:58+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"MediaTek designs and develops silicon wafers for wireless communications and digital multimedia solutions. The Taiwan-based company uses AWS to deploy its services internationally and give its IoT developers access to the company network so they can view dashboards, manage devices, and upgrade firmware remotely. By using AWS, MediaTek has reduced its time to development by 50 percent and expanded globally.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/customers/mediatek-logo.b62a9e875dd0a978371ee3a1ec21d7b85b323962.png","displayLocation":"Taiwan","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eMediaTek designs and develops silicon wafers for wireless communications and digital multimedia solutions. The Taiwan-based company uses AWS to deploy its services internationally, giving its IoT developers access to the company network, so they can access dashboards, manage devices, and upgrade firmware remotely. By using AWS, MediaTek has reduced its time to development by 50 percent and expanded globally.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Electronics \u0026 Semiconductors","sortDate":"2015-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mediatek/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"MediaTek","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"