019-07-22T19:52:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:08:02+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"WirelessCar is a wholly owned subsidiary of the Volvo Group and is the world\u0027s leading provider of automotive telematics services. The company has developed its own delivery engine—a test and development environment for its own software—based on Amazon EC2 and Amazon S3. The company can now scale test and development environments up and down according to requirements, and can make better-informed business decisions as a result.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/WirelessCar_Customer-Reference_Logo.bbd127d5d9de4fbae2959fc33d8334e5b8533e53.png","displayLocation":"Sweden","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eWirelessCar is a wholly owned subsidiary of the Volvo Group and is the world?s leading provider of automotive telematics services. The company has developed its own delivery engine?a test and development environment for its own software?based on Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud and Amazon Simple Storage Service. Now it?s able to scale test and development environments up and down according to requirements, and can make better-informed business decisions as a result.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Automotive","sortDate":"2015-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/wireless-car/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Wireless Car","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2015","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Wireless Car"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#dev-and-test","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Dev \u0026 Test","description":"Dev \u0026 Test","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:41+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","d