ication that allows customers to book and manage flights from their mobile devices.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/LOTPolishAirlines_Customer-Reference_Logo.4084fab7d40e980a1c395f7d998abf938a0f7d0d.png","displayLocation":"Poland","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003e: LOT Airlines is an award-winning carrier that connects Poland with nearly 60 destinations in Europe. LOT chose AWS to test, deploy, and run a mobile web application that allows customers to book and manage flights from their mobile devices. LOT now offers travelers a reliable, user-friendly mobile flight management tool and the company was able to lower IT maintenance costs.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Transport \u0026 Logistics","sortDate":"2015-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/lot-polish-airlines/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"LOT Polish Airlines","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2015","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: LOT Polish Airlines"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#sqs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","description":"Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:36+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#cee","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Central \u0026 Eastern Europe","description":"Central \u0026 Eastern Europe","dateCreated":"2020-03-10T05:12:39+0000","dateUpdated":