tomer-references#aws-case-study-usda-food-and-nutrition-service","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-usda-food-and-nutrition-service","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:58:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-01-21T02:43:03+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"The Food and Nutrition Service (FNS) administers the nutrition assistance programs of the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA). Using Amazon EC2, the FNS has launched a dynamic Web-based application called the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) Retailer Locator to help SNAP recipients find the nearest SNAP authorized stores.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/customers/usda-logo.14b00b09885524cab1dd5278b005b4c196f552df.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Food and Nutrition Service (FNS) administers the nutrition assistance programs of the U.S. Department of Agriculture (USDA). Using Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2), the FNS has launched a dynamic Web-based application called the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP) Retailer Locator to help SNAP recipients find the nearest SNAP authorized stores.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/usda-fns/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"USDA Food and Nutrition Service","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: USDA Food and Nutrition Service"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#cpg","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","description":"Consumer Packaged Goods (CPG)","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:03:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:00+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","date