","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eUbisoft, one of the world\u0019s largest gaming companies, publishes console, online and mobile games. The company selected the AWS Cloud to support its social game development and successfully launch 10 games in 18 months.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Gaming","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/ubisoft/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Ubisoft","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Ubisoft"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#content-delivery","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Content Delivery","description":"Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:38+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#high-performance-computing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"High Performance Computing","description":"High Performance Computing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#auto-scaling","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Auto Scaling","description":"AWS Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#gaming","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Gaming","description":"Gaming","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#americas","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Americas","description":"Americas","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#high-perform-compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"High Performance Compute","description":"High Performance Compute","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T06:37:26+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:41+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-newsweek","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-newsweek","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:56:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:44:08+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Newsweek specializes in print and online news coverage for a wide range of topics, including politics, business, and world events. Since 2009, the publication has reduced operating costs seventy-five percent by employing AWS as the foundation of its online presence.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/whiteboard-graphics/use-cases/Images/newsweek_daily_beast.7871470c000a34c9c5a3d00f9fc4ca879d25be11.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eNewsweek specializes in print and online news coverage for a wide range of topics, including politics, business, and world events. Since 2009, the publication has reduced operating costs seventy-five percent by employing Amazon Web Services (AWS) as the foundation of its online presence. Newsweek\u0026#39;s infrastructure was built using Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2), Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3), Amazon Relational Database Service (Amazon RDS), and Amazon CloudFront. Newsweek also uses Amazon Route 53, which saves the publication ninety-three percent in Domain Name System costs.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/newsweek/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Newsweek","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Newsweek"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cost Management","description":"Cost Management","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:12+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#datacenter-migration","locale":"en_US","tag