15 anni di costante crescita nel mercato della telefonia mobile italiano, oggi Vodafone conta più di 30 milioni di clienti mobili. Nell\u0027esercizio finanziario 2012 l\u0027azienda ha dichiarato più di 8 miliardi di USD di profitti derivati dai servizi.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/VodafoneItaly_Customer-Reference_Logo.c0d1be102898f136225385c08cb7cda97f88d089.png","displayLocation":"Italy","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eVodafone Italy wanted a secure solution that would make it easy for its customers to buy credit for mobile phone SIM cards. Working with AWS Partner Storm Reply, Vodafone created a compliant, secure solution on AWS that can scale to handle thousands of daily transactions while reducing capital expenditures by 30%.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Telecommunications","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/it/solutions/case-studies/vodafone-italy/","customer-name":"Vodafone Italy","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Storia del cliente","headline":"Caso di studio Vodafone Italia"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#italy","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Italy","description":"Italy","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:50+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#telecommunications","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Telecommunications","description":"Telecommunications","dateCreated":"2