u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/derbysoft/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"DerbySoft","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: DerbySoft"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#auto-scaling","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Auto Scaling","description":"AWS Auto Scaling","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#china","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"China","description":"China","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#network","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","description":"Elastic Load Balancing (ELB)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:03:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#aws-case-study-viskase","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-case-study-viskase","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T19:59:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:41+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"Viskase, a worldwide supplier of casing solutions for the food industry, collaborated with Protera Technologies to implement an SAP disaster recovery solution on AWS. Viskase realized a one-hour restore time and anticipates a 50 percent savings running the solution on AWS.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Viskase_Customer-Reference_Logo.a3a7d57c06941367981a2f6f8b3eb49211783361.png","displayLocation":"Americas","footerInfoText":"Published Date","description":"\u003cp\u003eViskase, a worldwide supplier of casing solutions for the food industry, collaborated with Protera Technologies to implement an SAP disaster recovery solution. With a 24-hour, 7-day worldwide operation, Viskase needed a solution that would have limited downtime with reasonable costs. Viskase realized a 1 hour restore time and anticipates a 50% cost savings running the disaster recovery solution on the AWS Cloud.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","industry":"Manufacturing","sortDate":"2014-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/viskase/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Viskase","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2014","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS Case Study: Viskase"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Cost Optimization","description":"\u003cp\u003eCost Optimization\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-13T00:08:24+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0