tomer-references#singsound","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"singsound","dateCreated":"2024-08-16T22:07:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-08-16T22:09:17+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"北京先声教育科技有限公司（以下简称“先声教育”）是一家AI技术服务商，目前落地在K12教育领域，创始团队来自腾讯、美国卡耐基梅隆大学（CMU），并已获得来自联想之星、思必驰、浙大友创、创世伙伴资本（CCV）投资方累计数千万美金投资。先声教育专注为教育机构提供在线口语、听说考试、写作评测系统及定制化技术服务，通过AI技术与教学场景的深度融合，升级传统教育模式，促进教学相长，推动效率改善。所服务的客户包括百度、好未来、新东方、拓维信息、海云天、全通教育、趣配音等。","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/logos/customers/China/singsound-logo.1118dd5c36f2fa8f5467d1da22390d092f971224.png","displayLocation":"China","customerNameLower":"singsound","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/cn/solutions/case-studies/singsound/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","customer-name":"Singsound","headline":"AWS 案例研究：先声教育","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudwatch","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon CloudWatch","description":"Amazon CloudWatch","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#polly","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Polly","description":"Amazon Polly","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:54+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#china","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"China","description":"China","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:38+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#workhuman-data-protection","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"workhuman-data-protection","dateCreated":"2024-06-12T18:23:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-06-13T20:01:45+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Workhuman’s social recognition software helps enterprises increase employee engagement, productivity, and satisfaction. The key: gratitude. Dealing with sensitive customer data, and adhering to General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and ISO 27001 standards, means data protection is “absolutely vital,” as vice president of architecture Mark Greville says. The Workhuman Cloud runs entirely on Amazon Web Services (AWS), and the company uses AWS support to help it create a secure architecture where customer and employee data is safe.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/workhuman-logo%401x.a8c8757fba6e8303cd6ca76ee18fae84d6bf3ad9.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/workhuman-logo%401x.a8c8757fba6e8303cd6ca76ee18fae84d6bf3ad9.png","displayLocation":"Europe","customerNameLower":"workhuman","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Professional Services","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/workhuman-data-protection/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Workhuman","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","headline":"Workhuman Protects Customer Data with Secure Architecture Built on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#prof-services","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Professional Services","description":"Professional Services","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:07:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:08+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#bedrock","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Bedrock","description":"Amazon Bedrock","dateCreated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-13T19:06:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#ai-ml","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","description":"Machine Learning \u0026 AI","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sage-sustainability","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sage-sustainability","dateCreated":"2024-06-12T18:23:47+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-18T00:53:32+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"For accountancy software provider Sage, sustainability isn’t just about what it can do within its organization. It’s about supporting millions of small and medium-sized business (SMB) customers around the world to do the same. Sage Earth is the company’s cutting-edge carbon reporting platform. It automates the process of tracking carbon emissions, making it easier for SMBs to understand their carbon footprints. As Mathias Karady—vice president and head of ESG product at Sage—says, using Amazon Web Services (AWS) to run Sage Earth gives it three big advantages: scale, the ability to attract and retain the best talent, and the opportunity for co-development. All of which is helping speed SMBs’ net zero journeys.","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/sage%402x.157a51746c8f0729035a1e770c5f71803c92787a.png","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/sage%402x.157a51746c8f0729035a1e770c5f71803c92787a.png","displayLocation":"Europe","customerNameLower":"sage","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Manufacturing","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/sage-sustainability/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Sage","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","headline":"Sage Automates Carbon Tracking for SMBs as Sage Earth Scales on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#manufacturing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Manufacturing","description":"Manufacturing","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:06+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#gen-ai","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Gen AI","description":"\u003cp\u003eGenerative Artificial Intelligence\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-07-10T17:07:31+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-10T17:07:31+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#enersis-sustainability-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"enersis-sustainability-case-study","dateCreated":"2024-02-20T00:04:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-06T23:23:19+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Although countries have reported their climate actions since 1990, the Paris Agreement, a treaty aiming to reduce climate change, mandates a consensus climate goal for all signatories starting in 2024. To facilitate the transition for cities, regions, and utility providers, Swiss climate-technology pioneer enersis built gaia.\ngaia provides a digital representation of physical objects—called a digital twin—so customers can understand current greenhouse gas emission sources, summarized through a dashboard. As a result, they can draw insights and track progress toward climate goals.","featured":"0","featureImageURL":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/enersis-climate-intelligence-logo%401x.66214af102513263c38b00c154c2741cce3787af.png","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/enersis-climate-intelligence-logo%401x.66214af102513263c38b00c154c2741cce3787af.png","displayLocation":"Europe","customerNameLower":"enersis","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Energy","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/enersis-sustainability-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"enersis","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2023","headline":"enersis Paves the Way for Greener Cities with gaia, a Climate Solution Built on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product